oom, not age (Lund absent). Q7: MRN is searched too — Novak (MRN-4100) is listed for both '41' and '410'. Q8 items (obrien without apostrophe, jose without accent, curly O’Brien) are manual, not run. 11 deleted\nAlso: [dev datasets] 通过; [本地 datasets] 通过"},"testCase":{"id":"90a69295feb80fbe8eea02d90482e6be","externalId":"0fecc2ea5410b7722b6a802da1b39a75","name":"[dev] S19 Search text edges, both contexts: apostrophes, hyphens, accents, partial and cross-field numbers","fullName":"TC-03 Search & Sort › TC-03/S19"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>S19</b> 「搜索文字的边界，两个模式：撇号、连字符、重音、部分数字和跨字段数字」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Search text edges, both contexts: apostrophes, hyphens, accents, partial and cross-field numbers</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U1</b> Hospital: search by name, by room, by MRN and by diagnosis each returns the correct matching patients, each field on its own.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 2；TFA-92581 AC 5）</li><li><b>U4</b> Nursing Home: search by name, by unit/room, by MRN and by facility each returns the correct matching residents, each field on its own.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 3；TFA-92581 AC 6）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>错误推测（error-guessing） — 专门去撞最容易出错的地方（失败、重复点、两个标签页、时钟不对、注入的指令）。</p><p><b>Given </b>Hospital: O'Brien 21, Smith-Jones 22, José Núñez 23, Patel 410, Ortiz 41, Novak 12 with MRN 'MRN-4100', Lund 7 with age 41 and MRN 'MRN-7000'. Nursing Home on Today's Visits: D'Angelo 'Rm 4', Patel 'Rm 410', Ortiz 'Rm 41', Novak 'Rm 12' with MRN 'MRN-4100'</p><p><b>When </b>Hospital: search &quot;o'brien&quot;, &quot;jones&quot;, &quot;José&quot;, '410', '41'. Nursing Home Today's Visits: search &quot;d'angelo&quot;, '41'</p><p><b>Then </b>Each name search lists exactly the named record. '410' lists Patel, not Ortiz or Lund. '41' lists Patel and Ortiz, not Lund (age is not a search field), in both contexts</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>cp1–cp3 mustContain the named patient and mustNotContain the other two punctuation names. cp4 mustContain Patel, mustNotContain Ortiz, Lund. cp5 mustContain Patel, Ortiz, mustNotContain Lund. cp6 mustContain QA Resident D'Angelo, mustNotContain QA Resident Ortiz and QA Hosp O'Brien. …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U73；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（blocked）</p><p><small>S19 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-03.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：PW · Playwright 脚本 — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-03/S19</p><p><b>Search text edges, both contexts: apostrophes, hyphens, accents, partial and cross-field numbers</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92581 Search &amp; Sort (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U73.verdict.json</code>), unit U73. Agent: 28 turns, 88 s, $0.17.</p><p><b>Plan said:</b> matrix-gap: legacy spec, needs[] not annotated — this run has a result anyway, so the result is shown.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U73 (#73, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Search text edges, both contexts. Whole-list order / search checks: its own seed only (matrix-gap fix 2026-10-14).</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #73, U73; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — apostrophe / hyphen / accent searches list exactly the named record; '41' and '410' match room, not age (Lund absent). Q7: MRN is searched too — Novak (MRN-4100) is listed for both '41' and '410'. Q8 items (obrien without apostrophe, jose without accent, curly O’Brien) are manual, not run. 11 deleted</p><p><b>这个用例别处也有结果</b>（一个用例只显示一个：有结论的优先于卡住，跑过的优先于跳过；同一档取较差的，一样差取先的（dev、dev 的 lane、本地 lane A/C、本地新 lane），测试过时排在通过前面；都是跳过时取 dev 的，除非 dev 只说「本地专用 / dev 上跑不了」或和 lane 同一个原因）：</p><ul><li><b>[dev datasets] 通过</b>（<code>datasets/results.json</code>） — datasets: passed → 通过（通过） 8 judged cell(s) held</li><li><b>[本地 datasets] 通过</b>（<code>datasets/results.json</code>） — datasets: passed → 通过（通过） 8 judged cell(s) held</li></ul>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-03 Search & Sort","S19 Search text edges, both contexts: apostrophes, hyphens, accents, partial and cross-field numbers"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"8134a34ea1843642ae9d6edbf095046d","originalFileName":"de3e9527-44ba-456c-8a2e-d0b5a9d586e9-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2481},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"b783b2093215e44edd70d6da2b29b0d8","originalFileName":"745dd3c7-97c7-4427-96e2-f597a2abe589-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"image/png","contentLength":73022,"name":"screenshot"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"b21ed91d638cb12d5520b13bff853aab","originalFileName":"8a5beb60-24a5-4f13-bebb-75b3ccf129a8-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2491,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"154727d9be1b273e6fb1702b2105b585","originalFileName":"5ee3117b-0957-4c3c-b52a-09c5c2aeeb2e-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"image/png","contentLength":73589,"name":"screenshot"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"cf632bbcb6e36b7a966092f20f73005b","originalFileName":"484ca243-8492-452c-a2a9-4f88bea3a9d4-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2497,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"7499d4f5e531789c97e811dc82b6a17d","originalFileName":"e59b76e9-2